"w":"door?","s":1.984,"e":2.4}]},{"who":"junie","text":"No idea. Good luck. Bye.","audio":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0784/8676/5621/files/ep-line-1795803763685-6.mp3?v=1795803766","words":[{"w":"No","s":0.107,"e":0.16},{"w":"idea.","s":0.208,"e":0.48},{"w":"Good","s":0.496,"e":0.56},{"w":"luck.","s":0.592,"e":0.8},{"w":"Bye.","s":0.88,"e":1.28}]},{"who":"narrator","text":"Junie's exit time: four seconds. A new record.","audio":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0784/8676/5621/files/ep-line-1795803763685-7.mp3?v=1795803766","words":[{"w":"Junie's","s":0.26,"e":0.48},{"w":"exit","s":0.528,"e":0.72},{"w":"time:","s":0.8,"e":1.2},{"w":"four","s":1.344,"e":1.92},{"w":"seconds.","s":1.99,"e":2.481},{"w":"A","s":2.76,"e":3.04},{"w":"new","s":3.12,"e":3.36},{"w":"record.","s":3.429,"e":4.08}]},{"who":"rosa","text":"Okay. Hats, capes, feathers. And you must be Gerald.","audio":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0784/8676/5621/files/ep-line-1795803763685-8.mp3?v=1795803766","words":[{"w":"Okay.","s":0.416,"e":0.8},{"w":"Hats,","s":0.864,"e":1.2},{"w":"capes,","s":1.3,"e":2},{"w":"feathers.","s":2.062,"e":2.64},{"w":"And","s":2.82,"e":3.36},{"w":"you","s":3.42,"e":3.6},{"w":"must","s":3.664,"e":3.92},{"w":"be","s":3.947,"e":4},{"w":"Gerald.","s":4.069,"e":4.88}]},{"who":"narrator","text":"Gerald is a mannequin. His name is on his foot.","audio":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0784/8676/5621/files/ep-line-1795803763685-9.mp3?v=1795803766","words":[{"w":"Gerald","s":0,"e":0.4},{"w":"is","s":0.48,"e":0.64},{"w":"a","s":0.7,"e":0.76},{"w":"mannequin.","s":0.79,"e":1.28},{"w":"His","s":1.46,"e":2},{"w":"name","s":2.08,"e":2.4},{"w":"is","s":2.48,"e":2.64},{"w":"on","s":2.693,"e":2.8},{"w":"his","s":2.84,"e":2.96},{"w":"foot.","s":3.04,"e":3.52}]},{"who":"rosa","text":"Nice to meet you, coworker. Don't move.","audio":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0784/8676/5621/files/ep-line-1795803763685-10.mp3?v=1795803766","words":[{"w":"Nice","s":0.336,"e":0.4},{"w":"to","s":0.42